### 7️⃣ The Core Claim — AgentRegistry.certify()

[`contracts/src/AgentRegistry.sol`](file:///c:/Users/Gupta/OneDrive/Desktop/rime/contracts/src/AgentRegistry.sol)

```solidity
// Lines 92-118: THE check — everything else is scaffolding for this
function certify(bytes calldata quote, bytes32 auditHash, uint64 epoch) external {
    // 1. Is this really TDX hardware?
    (bool ok,) = dcap.verifyAndAttestOnChain(quote);
    if (!ok) revert QuoteRejected();

    // 2. Recompute the commitment the same way the agent did
    bytes32 commitment = keccak256(abi.encode(auditHash, msg.sender, epoch));

    // 3. THE binding: does the quote's report_data match?
    (bytes32 hi, bytes32 lo) = TDXQuote.reportData(quote);
    if (hi != expected || lo != bytes32(0))
        revert CommitmentMismatch(expected, hi);

    // 4. Write the certificate with a freshness expiry
    certs[msg.sender] = Certificate({
        auditHash: auditHash, measurement: measurement,
        issuedAt: nowTs, expiresAt: nowTs + freshnessWindow
    });
}
```

